      "sourceSlug": "rag",
      "sourceTitle": "RAG that cites its sources",
      "headingPath": [],
      "content": "Retrieval-augmented generation only earns trust when it shows its work. Hybrid\nsearch, reciprocal rank fusion, a rerank pass, and numbered citations — so the\nmodel's answer points back at the source instead of asking you to take it on\nfaith.",
